# Editor and tool leftovers. Some in-place editors write the original beside the file they
# changed, and a stray copy of a source file is worse than useless: it compiles nowhere, and
# it reads as though someone meant to keep it.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# Local publish output, for putting profi-c and pc on PATH
dist/
